  "description": "I bet you thought you'd never utter \"oxtail\" and \"marmalade\" in the same breath. It is a sweet dish, sweetened with brown sugar and rich with red wine and red wine vinegar. There is something distinctly jam-like, I'll admit, about spreading the oxtail on toast.",
